This licence covers the code in code/ and the page scripts. The data files in
data/ are derived data released under CC BY 4.0 with these credits: schools
from the Department for Education (Get Information About Schools), the Welsh
Government, the Scottish Government and the Department of Education Northern
Ireland (all Open Government Licence v3.0); Northern Ireland locations from the
ONS Postcode Directory via postcodes.io; official catchments from the councils
listed in data/catchment_sources.csv (open map services, mostly Open Government
Licence v3.0; contains Ordnance Survey data, Crown copyright and database
right); boundaries from the ONS Open Geography Portal (Open Government Licence
v3.0); places from OS Open Names (Open Government Licence v3.0) and GeoNames
(CC BY 4.0); hill shading from AWS Terrain Tiles (Mapzen and Tilezen). The text
of the page and the figures are released under CC BY 4.0.
